@CatalogService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5241

### First page of the catalog
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/type/all
Accept: application/json

### Next page (use the nextId from the previous response)
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/type/all?after=9&pageSize=4
Accept: application/json

### Items for a brand
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/type/all/brand/1
Accept: application/json

### A single item
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/6
Accept: application/json

### 404 problem details
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/9999
Accept: application/problem+json

### 400 validation problem details
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/type/all?before=1&after=9
Accept: application/problem+json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{CatalogService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
